<http://idearq.org/resource/article/550764> a ns1:AcademicArticle ;
    dcterms:creator <http://idearq.org/resource/author/garcia_borja_pablo>,
        <http://idearq.org/resource/author/martins_haide>,
        <http://idearq.org/resource/author/perez_jorda_guillem>,
