    ns1:abstract "The following list consists of dates, obtained by liquid scintillation counting of benzene, for archaeologic samples mostly measured from June 1985 to June 1986." ;
    ns1:doi "10.1017/s0033822200056939" ;
    ns1:issn "0033-8222" .

