        <http://idearq.org/resource/author/ignacio_montero_ruiz>,
        <http://idearq.org/resource/author/j_j_de_la_rubia_de_gracia>,
        <http://idearq.org/resource/author/j_ramos_fernandez>,
        <http://idearq.org/resource/author/jose_l_vera_pelaez>,
        <http://idearq.org/resource/author/m_carmen_lozano_francisco>,
        <http://idearq.org/resource/author/maria_d_simon_vallejo>,
        <http://idearq.org/resource/author/miguel_cortes_sanchez>,
        <http://idearq.org/resource/author/r_aguilera_lopez> ;
