    ns1:abstract "The list of dates grouped below represents datings made during 1963. The method and the counting techniques have been previously described (Radiocarbon, v. 6, Saclay I)." ;
    ns1:doi "10.1017/s0033822200037243" ;
    ns1:issn "0033-8222" .

