<http://idearq.org/resource/article/959937> a ns1:AcademicArticle ;
    dcterms:creator <http://idearq.org/resource/author/adriana_soto>,
        <http://idearq.org/resource/author/alfonso_alday>,
        <http://idearq.org/resource/author/lourdes_montes>,
