    ns1:abstract "M. J. Aitken. Science-based dating in archaeology. xx + 274 pages, 91 figures, 18 tables. 1990. London & New York: Longman; ISBN 0-582-05498-2 hardback £22; 0-582-49309-9 paperback £12. - Volume 64 Issue 245" ;
