<http://idearq.org/resource/article/960281> a ns1:AcademicArticle ;
    dcterms:creator <http://idearq.org/resource/author/torres_perez_hidalgo>,
        <http://idearq.org/resource/author/trinidad_jose> ;
    dcterms:identifier "960281" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <http://idearq.org/resource/journal/0003-813X> ;
    dcterms:issued "2009"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dcterms:title "The Aminochronology of Man-Induced Shell Middens in Caves in Northern Spain" ;
    ns1:abstract "HHere, we provide the first report on the ages of 54 archaeological levels in 38 caves in northern Spain by means of the aspartic acid DIL ratio measurements in Patella shells, with good results. For this purpose, we developed an age calculation algorithm that allows the numerical dating of deposits from other archaeological localities in the area and nearby regions. We conclude that the sample size—that is, the number of shells analysed within a single level—reinforces the importance of analysing numerous specimens per horizon and the understanding of the time-aver aging concept. The ultrastructure of different species of Patella shells was also studied, showing calcite in their apexes and aragonite at their margins." ;
    ns1:doi "10.1111/j.1475-4754.2008.00383.x" ;
    ns1:issn "0003-813X" ;
    ns1:uri "https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/pdfdirect/10.1111/j.1475-4754.2008.00383.x" .

<http://idearq.org/resource/article/960282> a ns1:AcademicArticle ;
    dcterms:creator <http://idearq.org/resource/author/r_l_otlet> ;
    dcterms:identifier "960282" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <http://idearq.org/resource/journal/0033-8222> ;
    dcterms:issued "1977"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dcterms:title "Harwell Radiocarbon Measurements II" ;
    ns1:abstract "Since publication of Harwell I (R, 1974, v 16, p 178-191) the laboratory has been officially set up to operate a commercial radiocarbon dating service. To accommodate an increased number of samples the combustion and benzene synthesis rigs have been rebuilt as simultaneously-operated twin-line systems." ;
    ns1:doi "10.1017/s0033822200003738" ;
    ns1:issn "0033-8222" .

<http://idearq.org/resource/article/960283> a ns1:AcademicArticle ;
    dcterms:creator <http://idearq.org/resource/author/b_s_slade>,
        <http://idearq.org/resource/author/r_l_otlet> ;
    dcterms:identifier "960283" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <http://idearq.org/resource/journal/0033-8222> ;
    dcterms:issued "1974"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dcterms:title "Harwell Radiocarbon Measurements I" ;
    ns1:abstract "The Low-level Measurements Laboratory at AERE, Harwell was set up some years ago principally to measure natural levels of tritium in water for hydrologic applications. The measurement of 14 C in groundwater carbonates was a logical development from this work. In the period 1971–73 the measurement system has been extended to include archaeologic samples and this is the first list of dates for samples submitted during that period." ;
    ns1:doi "10.1017/s0033822200001545" ;
    ns1:issn "0033-8222" .

<http://idearq.org/resource/article/960284> a ns1:AcademicArticle ;
    dcterms:creator <http://idearq.org/resource/author/francesc_gusi_i_jener>,
        <http://idearq.org/resource/author/vicente_palomar_macian> ;
    dcterms:identifier "960284" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <http://idearq.org/resource/journal/1137-0793> ;
    dcterms:issued "1996"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dcterms:title "Campaña de Excavaciones en el Yacimiento del Calcolítico/Bronce de Cova Puntassa (Corachar, Castellón)" ;
    ns1:abstract "En este trabajo se presentan los resultados de la campana de excavacion arqueologica de Cova Puntassa, llevada a cabo por el Servicio de Investigaciones Arqueologicas y Prehistoricas en 1985. El sondeo proporciono una corta secuencia estratigrafica perteneciente a los perlados de la edad del bronce medio y del eneolitico, datado este ultimo mediante C-1 4 en el 2560 ± 110 aC. Los niveles del bronce fueron destruidos por una excavacion clandestina, en tanto que los correspondientes al eneolitico proporcionaron materiales arqueologicos que nos indican una presencia temporal de grupos pastoriles de caracter estacional. Es interesante senalar la presencia de estructuras de combustion de dicho periodo." ;
    ns1:issn "1137-0793" .

<http://idearq.org/resource/article/960286> a ns1:AcademicArticle ;
    dcterms:creator <http://idearq.org/resource/author/cesar_parcero_oubina> ;
    dcterms:identifier "960286" ;
    dcterms:issued "1997"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dcterms:title "Documentación de un Entorno Castreño: Trabajos Arqueológicos en el Área de Cameixa" ;
    ns1:abstract "Con una doble intencion metodologica y analitica, se abordan las diferentes actuaciones desarrolladas en el entorno del castro Cameixa (Boboras, Ourense), publicando las diversas evidencias arqueologicas reconocidas en esta zona e ilustrando el proceso trabajo seguido. La valoracion y analisis los resultados pretende demostrar como una actuacion las denominadas de rescate, con escasa inversion trabajo y tiempo, permite no solo salvar y corregir el impacto sobre elementos arqueologicos (intencion basica), sino tambien aportar nuevos datos e interpretaciones contenido arqueologico." .

<http://idearq.org/resource/article/960288> a ns1:AcademicArticle ;
    dcterms:creator <http://idearq.org/resource/author/jesus_lopez_requena>,
        <http://idearq.org/resource/author/josefa_pastor_cerezo>,
