<http://idearq.org/resource/book/959858> a ns1:Book ;
    dcterms:creator <http://idearq.org/resource/author/g_moreno_lopez>,
        <http://idearq.org/resource/author/ma_t_andres_ruperez>,
        <http://idearq.org/resource/author/r_j_harrison> ;
