    dcterms:issued "1998"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dcterms:title "Un Poblado de la Edad del Bronce en El Castillo (Frías de Albarracín, Teruel)" ;
    ns1:abstract "Detailed report on excavations at the Bronze Age site of El Castillo in south-western Spain. The aim was to study the subsistence economy and material culture of the Early Bronze Age. With descriptions of excavations, study of chronology, finds, human remains and palaeoeconomy." ;
    ns1:doi "10.30861/9780860548898" .

