<http://idearq.org/resource/book/960494> a ns1:Book ;
    dcterms:creator <http://idearq.org/resource/author/alexandre_varanda>,
        <http://idearq.org/resource/author/artur_ferreira>,
        <http://idearq.org/resource/author/filipa_rodrigues>,
        <http://idearq.org/resource/author/helena_gomes>,
        <http://idearq.org/resource/author/joao_zilhao>,
        <http://idearq.org/resource/author/luis_gomes>,
        <http://idearq.org/resource/author/pedro_souto> ;
    dcterms:identifier "960494" ;
    dcterms:issued "2020"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dcterms:title "Novos Trabalhos na Lapa da Bugalheira (Almonda, Torres Novas)" ;
    ns1:abstract "We present the results of the first year of the field work carried out at Lapa da Bugalheira (Almonda, Torres Novas) by the ARQEVO research project. We have identified an Early Neolithic occupation featuring a characteristic artefact assemblage with impressed wares (both cardial and “boquique”), geometric microliths and ornaments. The age of the assemblage has been corroborated by the radiocarbon dating of sheep and human bone samples. Comparable, coeval occupation contexts exist in the Central Limestone Massif of Estremadura, paramount among which is the Galeria da Cisterna’s (Almonda karst system)" ;
    ns1:doi "10.21747/978-989-8970-25-1/arqa60" .

